---
import {Image} from "astro:assets";
import Button from "./Button.astro";
import HomePageLink from "./HomePageLink.astro";
import headshot from "../assets/headshot.jpg";
---

<section
  class="mb-10 grid gap-6 md:mb-20 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] md:items-center md:gap-10 lg:gap-12"
>
  <div class="hero-fade-up">
    <div class="mb-4 flex items-start gap-4">
      <Image
        src={headshot}
        alt=""
        class="h-20 w-20 shrink-0 rounded-lg border border-blue/50 object-cover object-[center_30%] md:hidden"
        width={2048}
        height={3072}
        loading="eager"
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <h1 class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-1 mb-2 md:mb-4">
          Hi, I'm Becca.
        </h1>
        <p
          class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-2 editorial-prose font-sans text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed text-text md:mb-4 md:text-xl"
        >
          I speak and write about technology, community, and systems.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p
      class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-3 editorial-prose mb-6 leading-[1.8] text-text-muted"
    >
      Over the last decade I've built developer tools, design systems, data
      visualization platforms, and other software that people rely on every day.
      Along the way I've led teams, mentored engineers, spoken at conferences,
      and learned that the hardest problems are rarely purely technical.
    </p>
    <p
      class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-3 editorial-prose mb-6 leading-[1.8] text-text-muted"
    >
      These days, I'm increasingly interested in the intersection of technology
      and social science. How do people feel about work, and why? How is work
      changing in the AI era? For more on this, check out my most recent
      project: <a
        href="/making-things/language-of-work"
        class="underline hover:text-text">The Language of Work</a
      >.
    </p>
    <div
      class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-4 flex flex-col items-start gap-4"
    >
      <Button href="/writing">Read my essays</Button>
      <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-2">
        <HomePageLink href="/speaking-and-writing"
          >Speaking & Technical Writing</HomePageLink
        >
        <HomePageLink href="/making-things">Browse projects</HomePageLink>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div
    class="hero-fade-up hero-fade-up-delay-3 relative hidden w-80 justify-self-end md:block lg:w-96"
  >
    <Image
      src={headshot}
      alt="Headshot of Becca Bailey"
      class="h-auto w-full rounded-lg border border-blue/50"
      width={2048}
      height={3072}
      loading="eager"
    />
  </div>
</section>
